<title>UK: BayerVB sets 100 mln Ecu bond due December 2003.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 100 mln Ecu bond due December 2003.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Byerische Vereinsbank and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN ECU   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    31.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.237   PAY DATE  S-24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.687    SPREAD	+19 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.5O PCT OAT DUE 2003</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
